<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Shinunoga E-Wa"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Fujii Kaze"/><amll:meta key="album" value="HELP EVER HURT NEVER"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPPO02000610"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1505498792"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1748185866"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>藤井 風</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">勾指起誓 若吐半句谎言</text><text for="L2">千针万刃我也甘愿吞下 Monday</text><text for="L3">哪怕是周日也绝不改变</text><text for="L4">魔镜啊魔镜 谁才是这世间</text><text for="L5">能许我不渝之爱的那个人</text><text for="L6">何须多问 那便是我心爱之人</text><text for="L7">愿与你共赴此生终局</text><text for="L8">若要就这样同你作别</text><text for="L9">我宁愿就此死去</text><text for="L10">倒不如一死了之</text><text for="L11">胜过一日三餐 我只要你</text><text for="L12">与其就这样和你形同陌路</text><text for="L13">我宁愿就此了结</text><text for="L14">倒不如魂归黄泉</text><text for="L15">可这颗心仍难免偶尔浮躁摇摆</text><text for="L16">哪怕是至死难愈的顽疾 我也定会彻底根治 baby</text><text for="L17">因为我唯独属于你 baby</text><text for="L18">待到痛失所有才幡然醒悟</text><text for="L19">这般不堪的蠢事 我绝不想重演 Goodbye</text><text for="L20">切莫对我轻言离别</text><text for="L21">哎</text><text for="L22">愿陪伴我到最后的是你</text><text for="L23">若要就这样同你道别</text><text for="L24">我宁可随风逝去 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(宁可随风逝去)</span></text><text for="L25">倒不如就此了结 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(倒不如就此了结)</span></text><text for="L26">比起人间的烟火温饱 我更眷恋你</text><text for="L27">同你在此分道扬镳</text><text for="L28">我宁愿就此殒落 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(宁愿就此殒落)</span></text><text for="L29">倒不如一死了之 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(倒不如一死了之)</span></text><text for="L30">我生命的归宿唯有你一人</text><text for="L31">若要就这样与你诀别</text><text for="L32">我宁愿舍弃性命 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(宁愿舍弃性命)</span></text><text for="L33">倒不如就此长眠 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(倒不如就此长眠)</span></text><text for="L34">弃了这三餐温饱 我也要奔向你 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(只要奔向你)</span></text><text for="L35">与其与你就此作别 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(与你就此作别)</span></text><text for="L36">我宁愿就此死去 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(宁愿就此死去)</span></text><text for="L37">倒不如魂飞魄散 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(倒不如魂飞魄散)</span></text><text for="L38">即便这颗心仍会偶起微澜</text><text for="L39">如此不堪的动摇 我再也不需要了 byebye</text><text for="L40">我将永远与你紧紧相依 my baby</text></translation></translations><transliterations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><transliteration xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xml:lang="ja-Latn" xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><text for="L1"><span begin="0:24.365" end="0:25.217">yu bi ki ri </span><span begin="0:25.217" end="0:25.866">gen man </span><span begin="0:25.866" end="0:26.669">ho ra demo </span><span begin="0:26.669" end="0:27.461">fu i ta ra</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="0:27.471" end="0:27.841">hari </span><span begin="0:27.841" end="0:28.969">demo nan de mo </span><span begin="0:28.969" end="0:29.727">no ma se te </span><span begin="0:29.727" end="0:30.485">i ta da ki </span><span begin="0:30.485" end="0:30.954">Mon</span><span begin="0:30.954" end="0:31.764">day</span></text><text for="L3"><span begin="0:32.266" end="0:32.466">It</span> <span begin="0:32.466" end="0:32.835">doesn't</span> <span begin="0:32.835" end="0:33.219">matter</span> <span begin="0:33.219" end="0:33.421">if</span> <span begin="0:33.421" end="0:33.635">it's</span> <span begin="0:33.635" end="0:34.005">Sun</span><span begin="0:34.005" end="0:35.005">day</span></text><text for="L4"><span begin="0:36.588" end="0:37.202">ka ga mi </span><span begin="0:37.202" end="0:37.334">yo </span><span begin="0:37.334" end="0:37.946">ka ga mi </span><span begin="0:37.946" end="0:38.115">yo </span><span begin="0:38.115" end="0:38.809">ko no yo de </span><span begin="0:38.809" end="0:39.564">1 ban</span></text><text for="L5"><span begin="0:39.574" end="0:40.582">ka wa ru koto </span><span begin="0:40.582" end="0:41.125">no nai </span><span begin="0:41.125" end="0:41.530">ai </span><span begin="0:41.530" end="0:41.797">o </span><span begin="0:41.797" end="0:42.295">ku re ru </span><span begin="0:42.295" end="0:42.661">no wa </span><span begin="0:42.661" end="0:43.057">da</span><span begin="0:43.057" end="0:43.815">re</span></text><text for="L6"><span begin="0:44.294" end="0:44.682">No</span> <span begin="0:44.682" end="0:44.828">need</span> <span begin="0:44.828" end="0:44.928">to</span> <span begin="0:44.928" end="0:45.198">ask</span> <span begin="0:45.198" end="0:45.394">cause</span> <span begin="0:45.394" end="0:45.593">it's</span> <span begin="0:45.593" end="0:45.803">my</span> <span begin="0:45.803" end="0:46.162">dar</span><span begin="0:46.162" end="0:47.545">ling</span></text><text for="L7"><span begin="0:48.727" end="0:49.342">wa ta shi </span><span begin="0:49.342" end="0:49.609">no </span><span begin="0:49.609" end="0:50.277">sai go wa </span><span begin="0:50.277" end="0:51.060">a na ta ga </span><span begin="0:51.060" end="0:51.767">ii</span></text><text for="L8"><span begin="0:51.799" end="0:52.546">a na ta to </span><span begin="0:52.546" end="0:53.335">ko no mama </span><span begin="0:53.335" end="0:54.095">o sa ra ba </span><span begin="0:54.095" end="0:54.767">suru yori</span></text><text for="L9"><span begin="0:54.775" end="0:55.564">shi nu no ga </span><span begin="0:55.564" end="0:56.348">ii </span><span begin="0:56.348" end="0:57.275">wa</span></text><text for="L10"><span begin="0:57.862" end="0:58.624">shi nu no ga </span><span begin="0:58.624" end="0:59.397">ii </span><span begin="0:59.397" end="1:00.603">wa</span></text><text for="L11"><span begin="1:00.886" end="1:01.524">san do </span><span begin="1:01.524" end="1:01.648">no </span><span begin="1:01.648" end="1:02.043">me shi </span><span begin="1:02.043" end="1:02.381">yori </span><span begin="1:02.381" end="1:03.081">an ta ga </span><span begin="1:03.081" end="1:03.943">ii no yo</span></text><text for="L12"><span begin="1:03.943" end="1:04.700">an ta to </span><span begin="1:04.700" end="1:05.399">ko no mama </span><span begin="1:05.399" end="1:06.166">o sa ra ba </span><span begin="1:06.166" end="1:06.859">suru yo ka</span></text><text for="L13"><span begin="1:06.867" end="1:07.666">shi nu no ga </span><span begin="1:07.666" end="1:08.485">ii </span><span begin="1:08.485" end="1:09.481">wa</span></text><text for="L14"><span begin="1:09.967" end="1:10.766">shi nu no ga </span><span begin="1:10.766" end="1:11.550">ii </span><span begin="1:11.550" end="1:12.837">wa</span></text><text for="L15"><span begin="1:13.035" end="1:13.800">so re de mo </span><span begin="1:13.800" end="1:14.531">to ki do ki </span><span begin="1:14.531" end="1:15.323">u wa tsu ku </span><span begin="1:15.323" end="1:15.686">My</span> <span begin="1:15.686" end="1:16.054">Heart</span></text><text for="L16"><span begin="1:16.054" end="1:16.852">shin de mo </span><span begin="1:16.852" end="1:17.566">na o ra na </span><span begin="1:17.566" end="1:17.981">nao</span><span begin="1:17.981" end="1:18.332">shi te </span><span begin="1:18.332" end="1:19.067">mi se ma su </span><span begin="1:19.067" end="1:20.381">baby</span></text><text for="L17"><span begin="1:20.846" end="1:21.060">Yeah</span> <span begin="1:21.060" end="1:21.292">I</span> <span begin="1:21.292" end="1:21.478">ain't</span> <span begin="1:21.478" end="1:21.857">nothin</span> <span begin="1:21.857" end="1:22.060">but</span> <span begin="1:22.060" end="1:22.242">ya</span> <span begin="1:22.242" end="1:23.578">baby</span></text><text for="L18"><span begin="1:25.189" end="1:25.952">u shi nat te </span><span begin="1:25.952" end="1:26.701">ha ji me te </span><span begin="1:26.701" end="1:27.435">ki ga tsuku </span><span begin="1:27.435" end="1:28.137">nante</span></text><text for="L19"><span begin="1:28.206" end="1:28.789">sonna </span><span begin="1:28.789" end="1:29.741">da sai koto </span><span begin="1:29.741" end="1:30.092">mou </span><span begin="1:30.092" end="1:30.824">shi ta nai </span><span begin="1:30.824" end="1:31.256">no yo </span><span begin="1:31.256" end="1:31.662">Good</span><span begin="1:31.662" end="1:32.650">bye</span></text><text for="L20"><span begin="1:32.909" end="1:33.239">Oh</span> <span begin="1:33.239" end="1:33.404">Don't</span> <span begin="1:33.404" end="1:33.603">you</span> <span begin="1:33.603" end="1:33.950">ever</span> <span begin="1:33.950" end="1:34.406">say</span> <span begin="1:34.406" end="1:34.710">Bye</span><span begin="1:34.710" end="1:35.726">Bye</span></text><text for="L21"><span begin="1:36.115" end="1:37.306">Eh</span></text><text for="L22"><span begin="1:37.316" end="1:37.931">wa ta shi </span><span begin="1:37.931" end="1:38.198">no </span><span begin="1:38.198" end="1:38.866">sai go wa </span><span begin="1:38.866" end="1:39.649">a na ta ga </span><span begin="1:39.649" end="1:40.356">ii</span></text><text for="L23"><span begin="1:40.392" end="1:41.135">a na ta to </span><span begin="1:41.135" end="1:41.947">ko no mama </span><span begin="1:41.947" end="1:42.677">o sa ra ba </span><span begin="1:42.677" end="1:43.360">suru yori</span></text><text for="L24"><span begin="1:43.378" end="1:44.222">shi nu no ga </span><span begin="1:44.222" end="1:44.942">ii </span><span begin="1:44.942" end="1:45.943">wa </span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="1:44.956" end="1:45.746">(shi nu no ga </span><span begin="1:45.746" end="1:46.478">ii </span><span begin="1:46.478" end="1:47.221">wa)</span></span></text><text for="L25"><span begin="1:46.382" end="1:47.253">shi nu no ga </span><span begin="1:47.253" end="1:48.019">ii </span><span begin="1:48.019" end="1:49.224">wa </span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="1:47.952" end="1:48.720">(shi nu no ga </span><span begin="1:48.720" end="1:49.122">ii </span><span begin="1:49.122" end="1:49.540">wa)</span></span></text><text for="L26"><span begin="1:49.493" end="1:50.131">san do </span><span begin="1:50.131" end="1:50.255">no </span><span begin="1:50.255" end="1:50.650">me shi </span><span begin="1:50.650" end="1:50.988">yori </span><span begin="1:50.988" end="1:51.688">an ta ga </span><span begin="1:51.688" end="1:52.441">ii no yo</span></text><text for="L27"><span begin="1:52.511" end="1:53.304">an ta to </span><span begin="1:53.304" end="1:54.067">ko no mama </span><span begin="1:54.067" end="1:54.811">o sa ra ba </span><span begin="1:54.811" end="1:55.493">suru yo ka</span></text><text for="L28"><span begin="1:55.493" end="1:56.292">shi nu no ga </span><span begin="1:56.292" end="1:57.041">ii </span><span begin="1:57.041" end="1:58.106">wa </span><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="1:57.062" end="1:57.864">(shi nu no ga </span><span begin="1:57.864" end="1:58.455">ii </span><span begin="1:58.455" end="1:59.175">wa)</span></span></text><text for="L29"><span begin="1:58.575" end="1:59.374">shi nu no ga </span><span begin="1:59.374" end="2:00.098">ii </span><span begin="2:00.098" end="2